format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IWAKI, HARUHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUZAKI, FUMIAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAGI, EIICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Compositions for external use which contain zinc compounds, in particular, compositions for external use which contain zinc compounds and thiol compounds and compositions for external use which contain higher fatty acid zinc salts as the zinc compounds and polar oil derivatives having an I.O.B. value of 0.1 or above. These compositions can promote the production of metallothionein in skin cells and thus prevent skin injury due to solar UV light, etc. without causing any problem of offensive smell.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des compositions destinées à un usage externe et contenant des composés de zinc, des compositions destinées à un usage externe et contenant des composés de zinc et des composés de thiol, et des compositions destinées à un usage externe et contenant des sels de zinc d'acides gras supérieurs constituant les composés de zinc et des dérivés d'huile polaire ayant une valeur I.O.B. d'au moins 0,1. Ces compositions favorisent la production de métal-thionine dans les cellules cutanées et protègent ainsi des lésions cutanées causées par les rayons solaires ultraviolets, etc., sans aucun inconvénient d'odeur désagréable.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and